				<wikidot:authorName>MaxIrons</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2351538</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I love the article, the fact that she is an experiment, and deemed too potentially useful to euthanize hits home on just how gray-scale the SCP is. It's clinical, detached and precise. My only nitpick is that it's a bit too precise, although that may be for reasons not explained under the Data Expunged implants. (Auto repairs / creates systems by reusing plastics/metals in range, hence the very specific clothing and bedding requirements.</p> <p>+1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
