				<wikidot:authorName>Communism will win</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>617958</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>People who refrain from posting something rarely make mention of doing so, so the only copycats we know of are the ones that <em>do</em> get posted. I'm sure at least a few copycats have been warded away by excellent executions of common ideas &#8212; we just wouldn't know.</p> <p>Of course, I can't confirm this either, but it feels right in my gut that some people would have the good sense to try a different idea after seeing this niche filled.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
