						 <p>Ah, the good old "let's find an insignificant subject, apply X to him/her/it and see what happens" school of experimental science. The fact the subject/victim is a child only adds up to how disturbing this SCP is. The picture is great too! Last but not least, I am generally fond of cyborgs. Upvoted.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
